OL,3,GNEWSAGym offers student party night -
OL,4,Aminus the hangover
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We did a lot of going out last year
OL,7,Fand wanted to try something different."
OL,9,FStudent socialising has traditionally
OL,10,Frevolved around alcohol - but what are
OL,11,Fthe options for the growing numbers of
OL,12,Fyoung people at university who want to
OL,13,Fenjoy a night out without getting
OL,14,Fdrunk?
OL,16,FIn Nottingham, a new offering appears
OL,17,Fto have got off to a strong start.
OL,19,FFriends Phoebe Constanta and Ella
OL,20,FBirkwood are second-year students at
OL,21,FNottingham Trent University.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
